{%- comment -%}
  Free-shipping progress bar — "€X away from free shipping" with a fill track,
  switching to a success state once the cart clears the threshold.

  Threshold comes from settings.free_shipping_threshold (EUR, theme settings →
  Stock & delivery); 0/blank renders nothing, so the whole feature can be
  switched off without touching code. The claim is Slovenia-only, which the
  English string carries as "(SI)" — same convention as the trust strip.

  Rendered in re-fetched surfaces only (main-cart-items, the added-to-cart
  toast), so the numbers are always current: both surfaces re-render through
  the Section Rendering API on every cart change and the snippet recomputes
  from the fresh cart object. No JS.

  Accepts:
  - compact: {Boolean} once the threshold is reached, show a one-line
    "✓ ships free" confirmation instead of a full green bar (added-to-cart
    panel). The bar only earns its space while there is still a gap to close.

  Usage:
  {%- render 'free-shipping-bar' -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign fs_threshold = settings.free_shipping_threshold | default: 0 | times: 100
-%}
{%- if fs_threshold > 0 and cart != empty -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign fs_remaining = fs_threshold | minus: cart.total_price
    assign fs_pct = cart.total_price | times: 100 | divided_by: fs_threshold | at_most: 100
    assign fs_remaining_money = fs_remaining | money
  -%}
  <div class="free-shipping-bar{% if fs_remaining <= 0 %} free-shipping-bar--reached{% endif %}{% if compact %} free-shipping-bar--compact{% endif %}">
    <p class="free-shipping-bar__text">
      {%- if fs_remaining > 0 -%}
        {{ 'general.free_shipping.remaining' | t: amount: fs_remaining_money }}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- if compact -%}
          <span class="free-shipping-bar__check" aria-hidden="true">
            {{- 'icon-checkmark.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {{ 'general.free_shipping.reached' | t }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
    {%- unless compact and fs_remaining <= 0 -%}
    <div
      class="free-shipping-bar__track"
      role="progressbar"
      aria-valuemin="0"
      aria-valuemax="100"
      aria-valuenow="{{ fs_pct }}"
      aria-label="{{ 'general.free_shipping.label' | t }}"
    >
      <div class="free-shipping-bar__fill" style="width: {{ fs_pct }}%"></div>
    </div>
    {%- endunless -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
